WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.000
Mulder, I've seen it.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
I've seen how it begins.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.060
I'm here to offer you a deal.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.960
Civilization is its final stages.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.260
I'm asking you to betray the all human race.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.300
Do you mind if I smoke?

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.540
Kill him, before he kills us all.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.160
We want to save humanity.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.160
You want to see blood in the streets.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.160
The extermination of 7 billion people

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.980
I have to find our son.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.240
Mulder, they know that we know.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.240
We need your help

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.240
even if we don't trust you.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:21.960
How did we get here?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.920
My son is none of your business.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.420
It's a very special child.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:31.340
Williiam.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.740
You have to find him.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.720
And you have to stop him.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.780
Before he unleashes hell on earth.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.720
The truth still lies in the X-Files Muder

